            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaatsiga Zadoki omunyamurwa na beene ishe abanyamurwa omu maisho g'eihema rya MUKAMA eryabaire riri omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu, ogwabaire guri gibeoni, ",
