        {
          "text": " Kandi Hemani na Yeduduuni abo bakaba bagira amakondere n'ebitaasa eby'okuteera, n'ebindi bintu by'okuteerwa ahabw'ebyeshongoro ebirikwera. Kandi baataho batabani ba Yedusuuni kuba ab'okurinda eirembo.",
